{"2855180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Midnight Mazesoba", "steam_appid": 2855180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, atmospheric horror story designed to be experienced in a single, late-night sitting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Approximate Playtime:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~25 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open late at night, you’ve finally realized your dream of running a cozy mazesoba ramen stall. But it’s strange; no other food stands seem to be serving this late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boil noodles, chop toppings, and prepare the best midnight mazesoba in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/d0129bf9a5cd5f769a3361c4078524f7.poster.avif?t=1766116660\" width=1000 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/d0129bf9a5cd5f769a3361c4078524f7.webm?t=1766116660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/d0129bf9a5cd5f769a3361c4078524f7.mp4?t=1766116660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve a variety of late-night customers, keep up during meal rushes, and discover what happened to the other stalls that once lined the street.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/7004982b92b5fe694337fa8a52d18460.poster.avif?t=1766116660\" width=1000 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/7004982b92b5fe694337fa8a52d18460.webm?t=1766116660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/7004982b92b5fe694337fa8a52d18460.mp4?t=1766116660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each night, purchase new ingredients and upgrades for your stall. Some items can improve orders, while others might affect the strange events around your cart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/277ebf28087e8796beb50c2835ec6a67.avif?t=1766116660\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the night deepens, the  something in the air begins to shift. The streets  grow quiet and uneasy. Lights flicker, shadows stretch, and a sense of unease builds.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/8542574aaed7eafd64c2bacfd576f28e.poster.avif?t=1766116660\" width=1000 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/8542574aaed7eafd64c2bacfd576f28e.webm?t=1766116660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong>: Settle into the cozy, meditative rhythm of cooking and serving bowls of mazesoba, balancing preparation with the pace of customer orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery</strong>: Uncover why your cart is the only one still open after dark, and what happened to the rest of the late-night food vendors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: Focus on growing your reputation as a food stall owner. Horror elements are turned off, letting you decide between a purely cozy experience tinged with unsettling atmosphere. (Unavailable in the demo)</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, atmospheric horror story designed to be experienced in a single, late-night sitting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Approximate Playtime:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~25 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open late at night, you’ve finally realized your dream of running a cozy mazesoba ramen stall. But it’s strange; no other food stands seem to be serving this late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boil noodles, chop toppings, and prepare the best midnight mazesoba in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/d0129bf9a5cd5f769a3361c4078524f7.poster.avif?t=1766116660\" width=1000 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/d0129bf9a5cd5f769a3361c4078524f7.webm?t=1766116660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/d0129bf9a5cd5f769a3361c4078524f7.mp4?t=1766116660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve a variety of late-night customers, keep up during meal rushes, and discover what happened to the other stalls that once lined the street.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/7004982b92b5fe694337fa8a52d18460.poster.avif?t=1766116660\" width=1000 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/7004982b92b5fe694337fa8a52d18460.webm?t=1766116660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/7004982b92b5fe694337fa8a52d18460.mp4?t=1766116660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each night, purchase new ingredients and upgrades for your stall. Some items can improve orders, while others might affect the strange events around your cart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/277ebf28087e8796beb50c2835ec6a67.avif?t=1766116660\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the night deepens, the  something in the air begins to shift. The streets  grow quiet and uneasy. Lights flicker, shadows stretch, and a sense of unease builds.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/8542574aaed7eafd64c2bacfd576f28e.poster.avif?t=1766116660\" width=1000 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/8542574aaed7eafd64c2bacfd576f28e.webm?t=1766116660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong>: Settle into the cozy, meditative rhythm of cooking and serving bowls of mazesoba, balancing preparation with the pace of customer orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery</strong>: Uncover why your cart is the only one still open after dark, and what happened to the rest of the late-night food vendors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: Focus on growing your reputation as a food stall owner. Horror elements are turned off, letting you decide between a purely cozy experience tinged with unsettling atmosphere. (Unavailable in the demo)</p>", "short_description": "Midnight Mazesoba is a bite-sized atmospheric horror-cooking sim where you run a cozy ramen stall, serving warm bowls of mazesoba amid creeping shadows. Upgrade your shop, get to know your customers, and uncover the fate of the other late-night food carts.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/b1841ce47bc908e20fab9a3f6990825b32d7ab72/header.jpg?t=1766116660", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/403a00a1a9aaadb8399c372c2793ccea4400b06b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766116660", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/403a00a1a9aaadb8399c372c2793ccea4400b06b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766116660", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 3GB / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["MagiStone Games"], "publishers": ["MagiStone Games"], "demos": [{"appid": 4096320, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 499, "final": 499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$4.99"}, "packages": [1018462], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Midnight Mazesoba", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "